# Generated mockup renders. `mockup/expressive-flow/verify_flow.py` regenerates
# these (382 checks, 81 PNGs); they are output, not source. Tracked design input
# is the study source in mockup/expressive-flow/, one canonical render set in
# final-screens/ and delivery/, and the red-baseline sources in
# history/previous-study/ (flow.html, build_mockups.py, README.md).
mockup/expressive-flow/history/final-screens-failed-fit/
mockup/expressive-flow/history/final-screens-pass1/
mockup/expressive-flow/history/superseded-root-evidence/
mockup/expressive-flow/history/previous-study/screens/
mockup/expressive-flow/history/integration-first-run/
mockup/expressive-flow/history/landscape-removed/
mockup/expressive-flow/evidence/*/screens/

